gametitle=Grand Theft Auto: Liberty City Stories (NTSC-U SLUS-21423 / CRC 7EA439F5)
comment=Work in progress. On-foot Hold Camera adjustment prototype; not a release.
comment=Vehicle Follow height TEST; vehicle Free Look remains pending.

[GTA-PS2-Modern-Controls\LCS On-Foot Hold Camera Prototype\Enable]
author=Zeroable
description=Starts stock. Tap Down to toggle; Select cycles when enabled. Hold Down adjusts distance/FOV; add L1 for height/pitch. Cold boot; avoid experiment save states.
